  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plant the seeds of tomorrow for an Orphan child</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">These children are some of many hundreds of AIDS Orphans that likulezi has helped over the past 30 years to be enabled to go to primary school by supporting their Guardian with household costs, and business loans. With the advent of retroviral drugs for HIV infection Likulezi began to use resources to extend the education  from primary  into Secondary and from there  to get some as far as 3rd level! this has been a great boost to this poor  community as Education is their  way out of Poverty .</narrative>
  </description>
